Package: trialemulationj
Type: Package
Title: Causal Trial Emulation for Jamovi
Version: 1.1.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Gary", "Bass", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "maintainer@example.org"),
    person("TrialEmulationj", "Contributors", role = "ctb")
    )
Description: Causal inference workflows for jamovi. Supports prospective target
    trial specification, landmark and sequential target trial emulation,
    clone-censor-weight survival analyses, augmented inverse probability
    weighting for point outcomes, doubly robust survival estimation, causal
    directed acyclic graphs, diagnostic plots, and reproducible analysis
    fingerprints. Includes safeguards for time-zero alignment, missingness,
    positivity, separation, clustering, and model diagnostics.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
